        "ggB0gS80Mrg_text": "<p>The 2023 Rated Innovation in Cosmetics</p>",
        "ggG39andQvJ_text": "<p>Hydrate, rejuvenate, and glow with our revolutionary cream. Unleash your skin's potential today.</p>",
