        "ggML_E28HO8_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/gempages_432750572815254551-7b7b6beb-2475-4cab-a8a5-5bad2acafc04.png?v=1717574059",
        "ggxp37wq97j_text": "<p>“This skin cream is a game-changer! It has transformed my dry, lackluster skin into a hydrated and radiant complexion. I love how it absorbs quickly and leaves no greasy residue. Highly recommend”</p>",
        "ggznKcAaC3M_text": "<p>Hannah N. (Houston, USA)</p>",
        "ggPEElhP3yG_childItem_0": "<p>Benefits</p>",
        "ggPEElhP3yG_childItem_1": "<p>Ingredients</p>",
        "ggPEElhP3yG_childItem_2": "<p>How to use</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_0": "<p>Within seconds, cools and refreshes skin*</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_1": "<p>In 2 weeks, helps balance skin's sebum levels to keep skin looking healthy and fresh**</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_2": "<p>Reveals a firmer, more lifted ageless look within weeks***</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_3": "<p>In 4 weeks, 87% said the appearance of pores was minimized****</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_4": "<p>Miracle Broth™ helps balance sebum levels and prevent irritation</p>",
        "ggPzFgawRCt_childItem_5": "<p>Moisture Matrix Technology creates a cushion of healing moisture that diffuses youth-renewing activity into skin </p>",
        "ggzQgn8qXzg_text": "<p>*Clinical testing on 27 women after using product once. **Clinical testing on 31 women after using product for two weeks, twice daily </p><p>***Clinical testing on 53 women after using product for 8 weeks, twice daily </p><p>****Consumer testing on 130 women after using product for 4 weeks, twice daily</p>",
        "ggiVUxBAR-G_text": "<p>Water\\Aqua\\Eau, Dimethicone, Algae Extract, Glycerin, Yeast Extract\\Faex\\Extrait De Levure, Trisiloxane, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Alcohol Denat., Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Butylene Glycol, Isopentyldiol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Citrus Aurantifolia (Lime) Peel Extract, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Oil, Medicago Sativa (Alfalfa) Seed Powder, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seedcake, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Seed Meal, Eucalyptus Globulus (Eucalyptus) Leaf Oil, Sodium Gluconate, Copper Gluconate, Calcium Gluconate, Magnesium Gluconate, Zinc Gluconate, Tocopheryl Succinate, Niacin, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Powder, Bis-Peg-18 Methyl Ether Dimethyl Silane, Lactobacillus Ferment, Trametes Versicolor Extract, Trehalose, Squalane, Laminaria Saccharina Extract, Sigesbeckia Orientalis (St. Paul's Wort) Extract, Caffeine, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Whey Protein\\Lactis Protein\\Proteine Du Petit-Lait, Hydrolyzed Rice Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Laminaria Digitata Extract, Caprylyl Glycol, Iris Florentina Root Extract, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8</p>",
        "ggPMrMH7Tq-_text": "<p>Pat a small amount between fingertips and press gently into cleansed skin, morning and night.</p>",
        "ggpFuaKDNd5_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/gempages_432750572815254551-862cdf2e-aba6-4086-86e1-6aedcbdae31d.png?v=1717581703",
